   * **Related Operations**
   *
   * - `GET /projects/{projectId}/members` - List current project members
   * - `POST /projects/{projectId}/members` - Assign employee to project
   * - `PUT /projects/{projectId}/members/{employeeId}` - Update member role
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param projectId UUID of the project from which to remove the employee
   * @param employeeId UUID of the employee to remove from the project
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Delete project membership record linking employee to project. Implementation steps:
   *
   * 1. Validate projectId and employeeId are valid UUIDs
   * 2. Verify project exists and belongs to authenticated user's organization context
   * 3. Verify employee exists and belongs to the same organization
   * 4. Verify membership record exists for this project-employee combination
   * 5. Check user has project:manage permission for this project
   * 6. Soft delete the membership record by setting deleted_at to current timestamp
