   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Query the hrm_timelogs table by primary key (id). Validate the timelog exists and is not soft-deleted (deleted_at IS NULL). Check authorization: verify the authenticated user either owns the timelog (hrm_employee_id matches user's employee record) or has time:view_all or time:manage permission in the organization. Join with hrm_employees to get employee details, hrm_projects for project information, and optionally hrm_tasks for task details. Return the complete timelog entity with all related information. Return 404 if not found, 403 if unauthorized.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
